WEBVTT

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.750
It's so cold, I can't sleep.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.040
Maybe I'll drink some warm milk...

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:30.770
Huh?

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.130
There's a nice smell 
coming from the kitchen...

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:47.900
Aki-chan, Aki-chan, Aki-chan, Aki-chan...

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:24.990
<b>The Place We Longed to Reach</b>

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:30.370
M-Mayu-chan, what are you making?

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:32.500
Hina-chan?

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:34.930
I'm prepping for tomorrow.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.010
A-At this hour?

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:41.100
Also, you're acting kind of strange.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:45.070
You were muttering the landlady's name...

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:47.270
I-I was not!

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:50.490
Hina-chan, you must be half-asleep 
and hearing things!

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:52.520
Hurry up and get to bed!

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:55.790
Come on, right now! Hurry!

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:55.790
<i>Sh-She's hiding something!</i>

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.280
<i>I'm suspicious!</i>

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:59.700
Show me what you're making.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:00.280
Huh?!

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:04.580
N-No! It's a secret until tomorrow!

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:07.160
You can't look! You can't look!

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:12.680
She's so cute, I can't pursue it any further!

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:13.920
Huh?

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.370
I'll go talk to Kuu-chan!

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:17.920
Oh, my...

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:21.780
Kuu-chan, are you still awake?

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.050
I sure am.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.060
What brings you here at this hour?

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.520
W-Well, Mayu-chan was muttering 
the landlady's name

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:32.920
while dressed like a witch 
and stirring a big pot!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.810
C-Calm down! What on Earth happened?!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.440
Mayu-chan was muttering the landlady's name

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.490
while making something in a big pot!

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:45.160
It must have been the kind of 
creepy potion that witches make!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.960
A creepy potion?

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.640
Like a paralyzing potion...

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:49.540
Huh?!

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.540
C-Creepy potion...

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:56.870
I'll go sneak a taste of it!

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:00.420
You can't!

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.930
<i>Come to think of it, 
isn't tomorrow Valentine's Day?</i>

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.990
Will the landlady be okay?

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:11.560
What if there's some kind of incident?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.600
What if we wake up in the morning 
to find the landlady unconscious?!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.690
That sounds like the premise 
of a mystery novel!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:24.200
Let's say, for example, the landlady 
doesn't wake up in the morning.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:27.100
So we go to her room to check on her, and...

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.580
And?

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:34.180
And we find her in the middle of changing, 
in a very immodest position!

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:39.420
<b>Hitotose</b>

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:47.180
I was so worried about the landlady, 
I couldn't get any sleep.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:49.930
Oh, Hina-chan. Good morning.

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:52.090
M-Miss Landlady!

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:56.210
You look a bit pale. Are you okay?

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.940
Um, I...

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:02.150
<i>What now? Where should I even start?</i>

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:08.360
P-Please take extra good care of yourself!

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:11.100
Huh? Th-Thanks.

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:12.580
Same to you.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.830
Aki-chan! Good morning!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.890
Here, this is for you!

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:19.460
Thanks for doing this every year.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:22.670
Miss Landlady! 
I'll check it for poison first!

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.840
Poison?

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.470
I've got some for you, too, Hina-chan.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:31.470
Did I do something to make you hate me?

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:34.450
Th-They're just Valentine's 
chocolates, Hina-chan!

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:36.730
What are you so afraid of?

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:42.960
Aki-chan and I were making chocolates 
to serve at the coffee shop.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.860
Huh? But why were you dressed like that?

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:48.890
It was really cold last night.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:51.240
<b>Dressed 
Warmly</b>

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:51.240
It made cooking so uncomfortable.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:55.290
And why were you muttering 
the landlady's name?

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.620
Because...

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.680
I heard if you chant the name of the person
 you're making chocolate for,

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:01.490
it'll taste better.

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:04.000
I saw it written in a book of spells.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:06.140
So that's it!

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:09.640
I was sure you were making 
some kind of potion to paralyze the landlady!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:14.520
Hina-chan, you come up with 
some of the most outlandish insults...

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:20.900
<i>I made this chocolate for Chiaki-senpai,</i>

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.020
<i>but will I be able to give it to her?</i>

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.410
Chiaki-senpai...

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:34.160
I've always been watching you.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:35.960
I really admire you!

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:39.160
Please accept this!

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:47.920
Okay!

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:49.840
I've got it all planned out!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.680
Chiaki-senpai!

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:06.450
Thank you.

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:08.690
<i>R-Reality is harsh!</i>

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.690
I appreciate it. Thank you.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.200
If I hesitate too long, I'll miss my chance!

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:13.970
Thank you.

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:15.160
Well, bye.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.700
Chiaki-senpai!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.710
Oh, Yua-chan.

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:20.920
Um...

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.340
U-Um...

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.090
Well...

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.410
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:35.140
<i>Now that she's right in front of me, 
I'm so nervous...</i>

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.160
<i>But I have to give it to her!</i>

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.730
Miss Landlady! Happy Valentine's Day!

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.490
I bought this at the school store!

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.300
Thank you, Hina-chan.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:48.390
Wow, you've got lots of them!

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:49.110
Yeah.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:53.650
Why are you so mentally strong 
only at times like this?

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.740
Yua-chan? What's wrong?

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:58.990
Hinako...

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:02.100
Come with me. 
I want your help with something.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:03.250
What is it?

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:06.510
I want to give chocolate to Chiaki-senpai,

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:10.010
but when I try to be honest about 
how I feel, I get embarrassed.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:13.080
<i>I thought her behavior 
made it obvious enough...</i>

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.480
Oh, Mayu-chan.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:17.040
Mayu-senpai...

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:21.710
Oh? Yua-chan, have you not been able to 
give your chocolate to Aki-chan yet?

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:22.140
Huh?!

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:25.770
H-How did you know I'm giving it to her?!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.970
Do you have ESP?!

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:30.030
It's pretty obvious just from watching you.

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:34.240
Please accept this.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.540
Thank you.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.650
Your hair accessory is crooked.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.790
Th-Thank you!

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:48.530
Aki-chan's pretty, and really nice to boot.

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:50.920
Even the girls love her.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.050
I see... That's very true.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.850
A long time ago,

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:58.340
she saved me when I was 
surrounded by older students.

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:58.930
Huh?

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.470
Well, aren't you cute?

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:08.150
Super cute.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:09.920
Hold it right there!

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:10.570
Huh?

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.850
Wh-Wh-Who the heck are you?!

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:15.070
Aki-chan! You came for me?

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.450
Beat it!

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:25.010
In spite of how she looks, is the landlady 
actually a delinquent at heart?

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:27.080
I-It wasn't like that...

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:30.090
It was my first day of school.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:32.640
You're so tiny and cute!

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:33.550
Are you new?

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:34.340
What's your class?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.570
U-Um...

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.070
You look like a doll!

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:39.090
Come here and I'll give you some candy!

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:41.300
Look, she's blushing!

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:44.560
Um, you're making Mayu-chan uncomfortable.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.230
Are you new, too?

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.690
You're really pretty!

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:50.240
Your hair's so smooth!

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:52.790
And your figure's perfect! 
Look at that waist!

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:56.240
U-Um, excuse me... I don't...

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:59.820
So that's how Aki-chan helped me.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:03.120
<i>I guess it's not easy being beautiful...</i>

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.620
I get nervous whenever I see Senpai's face,

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:11.500
so I'd like you to give her this for me...

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:12.980
I can't!

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:15.600
You put all your heart into making it,

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.380
so you have to give it to her yourself!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:21.890
I'm sure she'll understand your feelings.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.350
Hinako...

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:28.640
You're right. I chanted 
her name while I made it.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:33.120
Chiaki-senpai, Chiaki-senpai, Chiaki-senpai...

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.700
I'm sure she'll accept it.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.280
Y-Yeah...

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:40.530
<i>I guess she read 
the same book Mayu-chan did.</i>

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.430
I'm going!

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.290
Good luck!

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:48.120
Chiaki-senpai!

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:51.700
Please accept this!

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:01.840
Um, I've always watched you, and...

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.800
Yep, I know.

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:06.930
I always thought we seemed 
to make eye contact a lot.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.670
<i>I-I'm so embarrassed!</i>

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.410
Thank you for the chocolate.

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:12.970
I'd like to give you something in return.

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:15.940
Can you come to the shop after school?

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.940
Huh? I really can?

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:23.700
Your expressions change at the 
drop of the hat. It's so neat.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:29.450
<b>Coffee Shop</b>

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:33.710
I wonder what Senpai wants 
to give me in return...

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.710
I'm here... Huh?

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.110
Have some chocolate.

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:40.200
Thanks.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:41.860
Yua-chan!

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:44.100
Yua-chan, welcome.

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:47.720
We're giving chocolate 
to all our customers today.

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.730
Mayu-chan made them! 
Come in and have some!

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:56.280
<i>Chiaki-senpai in a maid outfit...</i>

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.490
What a feast for the eyes!

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:03.990
Sh-She was so happy, it made her cry?!

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:21.260
We sure had lots of customers 
yesterday, huh?

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:26.270
Yeah. We gave away almost 
all the chocolate I made.

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:27.640
You're right!

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:34.770
As the landlady, the boost in sales 
yesterday makes me very happy.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:38.150
It must be because of 
your chocolate, Mayu-chan.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:39.860
You think so?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:43.530
I think it had more to do with how you and 
Hina-chan looked in the maid outfits.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.010
By the way, Mayu-chan...

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:48.660
Hm?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.160
Are you free this afternoon?

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:54.650
Huh? I don't have anything 
planned for today...

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:58.790
I can't call it thanking you 
for the Valentine's chocolate,

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:01.920
but if you like, why don't we...

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.930
Is Aki-chan asking me...

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:07.930
Sure!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:10.930
<b>Chocolate Rhapsody No. 8 
Old Town Factory 
Shimokita Theater</b>

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.250
Wow! Tickets to a play?

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:17.190
I got a bunch of them from a friend,

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:23.940
so I wanted to invite all of you 
as thanks for the Valentine's chocolate.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:27.820
Um, I'd be happy to, but...

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:34.720
Mayu-chan seems to be  
pouting about something.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:36.820
Did something happen?

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:40.460
I'm not really sure...

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:46.470
Mayu-chan, here.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:51.100
I'm not really into plays.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.350
Hey, isn't this...

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.370
What is it, Hina-chan?

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:02.360
The theater where this is 
being held... is it...

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:06.490
<b>Shimokita Theater</b>

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:06.490
Hmm... It says "Shimokita Theater."

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:12.870
Isn't this the place where 
we want to perform, Suzuran, is?

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.820
It's near there.

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:19.370
So when we go to see the play, 
can we also take a look at Suzuran?

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:22.930
Sure, if we leave a bit early.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:25.580
Great! I'm so happy!

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.260
I'm excited, too!

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:30.800
I bet there's a lot of great food 
around there, too!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.790
<i>That's</i> what you're excited for?

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.770
Mayu-chan, here.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:47.960
Suzuran...

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:54.530
<b>Closed Today 
Sorry!</b>

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:58.570
Hina-chan, hurry up!

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:00.170
Just a second!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.420
I'm glad you decided to 
come along, Mayu-chan.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.610
Yeah.

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:09.170
Well, I was the one who told 
Hina-chan about Suzuran.

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:11.080
That's true.

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:13.550
That was when we found our goal.

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:16.680
Sorry for the wait!

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:20.670
Well, we're going to check out 
Suzuran before the play, right?

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:22.060
So let's hurry!

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:25.630
Aki-chan, you didn't forget 
the tickets, did you?

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:27.190
Nope. All set.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.860
Kuu-chan, you didn't forget to 
lock up the bookstore, did you?

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.570
Nope! All set!

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.480
Okay, then! Let's go!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:36.700
Mayu-chan!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.580
Did you lock the coffee shop?

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:49.340
Looks like there's no place to sit.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.780
Let's head more toward the middle.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:12.180
You could just grab that rail...

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:15.360
I'm fine! I can reach it on my tiptoes!

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:18.490
Would you like to have my seat, dear?

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.270
Please don't worry about me...

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:22.340
That's just like Mayu-chan.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:24.120
So cute!

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:28.740
The train arriving now is the 
express train bound for Shibuya.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.200
This way. Follow me.

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:42.180
This sure is a complicated route.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.600
It's like a maze.

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:47.230
This station has been under 
construction for a long time.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:53.520
This way.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.640
It's easy to get the exits 
mixed up in this station.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:03.620
<b>South Exit</b>

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:03.620
<b>South Exit This Way</b>

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:03.620
<b>Welcome to 
Shimokitazawa!</b>

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.620
You're right.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:06.000
I'd get lost here in a heartbeat.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.170
Um...

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.380
Hina-chan isn't behind us.

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.380
Hina-chan!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.680
Wh-Where is everyone?

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.640
Hello?

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.020
Hina-chan? Where are you?

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.310
U-Um... I'm...

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.440
I'm not sure where I am!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.340
W-Wait just a second, Hina-chan.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.450
We'll just have to look for her ourselves.

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:41.450
According to the map...

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.460
She came downstairs with us,

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:44.740
so she's probably at the north exit.

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:46.320
A-Aki-chan...

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:47.210
Yeah.

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:51.210
This is a shortcut.

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.120
She's not here...

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:57.590
Yeah, I don't see her.

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:03.600
Hina-chan? Where are you now?

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.480
I'm not sure where I am!

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.620
Why did you move?!

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:10.610
I went looking for you!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.380
We finally found each other!

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:19.030
Jeez, why'd you move 
when you were the one who got lost?

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.640
I'm sorry...

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:23.190
No, Hina-chan, you did well!

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:24.870
Eh? Kuu-chan?

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:28.660
Thanks to you, I got to buy up all the best food 
from the shops around the station!

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:30.110
Kuu-chan, that's amazing!

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:31.630
When did you...

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.630
<b>Honma Theater</b>

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:41.140
<b>"Seki" Mini Theater</b>

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:43.580
What's up, Hina-chan?

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:48.890
I feel like we're seeing theaters everywhere 
just by walking through here.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:52.850
This town is known as the "town of theater."

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:54.270
<b>Honma Theater, The Suzuran, Train Station Mini Theater, 
"Seki" Mini Theater, Rakuen Mini Theater, Theater 717</b>

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:54.270
Wow!

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:59.490
And the one that started it all 
is right over there.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.280
<b>Suzuran Alley</b>

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.280
<b>The Suzuran</b>

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:02.280
So that's...

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.530
Suzuran!

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:10.290
<b>Suzuran Alley</b>

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:10.290
<b>The Suzuran</b>

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.630
This is my first time seeing it, too.

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:10.290
It's a very classical-looking building.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:11.520
Are you surprised?

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:15.300
Yeah! I'd love to take a look inside 
if we ever have a chance!

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:21.050
<b>Suzuran Alley</b>

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:21.050
<b>The Suzuran</b>

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:19.190
It feels so historical, somehow.

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:21.050
Yeah, it does.

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:25.680
<i>I hope I can stand on the stage 
here someday...</i>

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:50.460
Thank you all for coming today!

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:57.460
Did you enjoy the play?

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:58.970
It was great!

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:02.090
I think I could learn a lot from that script.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:05.090
I cried a little.

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:08.020
I still feel really moved...

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:10.210
It moved you that much?

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:13.230
It was a comedy. What part made you cry?

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:17.990
No way! The last part was really emotional!

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:23.110
See? There's someone crying over there, too!

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:25.620
Huh?

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:30.240
Yua-chan!

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:31.880
H-Hinako?

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.400
Chiaki-senpai!

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:36.150
What a coincidence!

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:37.380
Everyone...

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:40.290
This really is quite a coincidence.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.010
Ruri-chan!

00:20:41.310 --> 00:20:42.680
Sensei?

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:44.970
Since we're all here,

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.890
why don't we all go back to 
the coffee shop for dinner?

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:50.730
Would it be all right if I joined you?

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:51.810
Of course!

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:56.600
It'll be fun to talk about 
the play over dinner.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:59.190
Yes, I'm sure it'll be a 
productive conversation.

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:01.440
Come with us, Yua-chan!

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:05.200
That aside, why are you all 
here with Chiaki-senpai?

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:07.460
I'm sorry, Yua-chan.

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:11.830
I invited them all to 
thank them for Valentine's Day.

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.960
I should have told you about it, too.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.460
N-No, I didn't mean...

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:20.590
I've been theater-hopping 
since this morning, so...

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:26.760
So you were moved to tears too, 
huh, Yua-chan?

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:30.470
I-I just had something 
in my eyes, that's all.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.520
But it was a great play, wasn't it?

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:35.150
Y-Yeah...

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:38.050
You two might actually 
be pretty similar, huh?

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:39.550
Maybe!

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:41.360
We are not!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:45.900
Anyway... I wish I could've gone 
to Suzuran with everyone, too.

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:47.480
You've seen it before, haven't you?

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:49.690
I have, but I wanted to see it together!

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:51.130
Let's go again sometime!

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:54.020
Huh? F-Fine.
